---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout';
import { siteConfig } from '@/data/site';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Ms V Lab Privacy Policy - how we collect, use, and protect your data." noIndex={true}>
  <article class="prose-custom lg:prose-lg xl:prose-xl max-w-none">
    <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 mb-8">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <h3>Analytics Data</h3>
    <p>We use privacy-friendly analytics (Plausible/Fathom) that do not use cookies or collect personal identifiers. We track: page views, referrers, country, device type, browser. No IP addresses stored.</p>

    <h3>Newsletter Subscriptions</h3>
    <p>If you subscribe, we collect your email address. We use it only to send our newsletter. You can unsubscribe anytime via the link in every email.</p>

    <h3>Contact Forms</h3>
    <p>When you email us, we receive your email address and message content. We use this only to respond to you.</p>

    <h3>Affiliate Link Clicks</h3>
    <p>When you click an affiliate link, the merchant may place a cookie to track referral. We do not control or access this data.</p>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Send newsletter (with consent)</li>
      <li>Respond to inquiries</li>
      <li>Improve site content (aggregated analytics)</li>
      <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We never sell your data.</p>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — CDN, DDoS protection, analytics (no personal data)</li>
      <li><strong>Formspree</strong> — newsletter signup processing</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate networks</strong> (Amazon Associates, Impact, ShareASale, etc.) — track referrals via cookies</li>
      <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> — self-hosted via our build, no external requests</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We set <strong>no first-party cookies</strong>. Third-party cookies may be set by affiliate networks when you click product links. You can block these via browser settings.</p>

    <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Under GDPR/CCPA, you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access your data</li>
      <li>Rectify inaccurate data</li>
      <li>Erase your data (unsubscribe from newsletter)</li>
      <li>Restrict processing</li>
      <li>Data portability</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:{siteConfig.author.email}">{siteConfig.author.email}</a> to exercise these rights.</p>

    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Newsletter emails: until unsubscribe</li>
      <li>Contact emails: 1 year</li>
      <li>Analytics: aggregated, no personal identifiers</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. Changes posted here with updated date. Continued use = acceptance.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{siteConfig.author.email}">{siteConfig.author.email}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
